###
Short Film: "Tea Ariduchu"

Genre: Romance / Slice of Life / 10-12 min

### Opening Scene (1 min)

Morning. Empty road. Soft breeze.

A young man in formal clothes stands by the roadside holding a bouquet. He's visibly nervous. Cars pass without stopping.

One car passes him...

...then suddenly brakes.

It reverses.

Window rolls down.

Driver (smiling, nodding):

> "Vanga bro."

The passenger hesitates, smiles in relief, gets in.

Cut to title-less drive.

### Scene 2: Inside the Car (2 min)

Natural, casual conversation.

Driver

> "Enga bro poganum? Romba nervous-ah vera irukkinga."

Passenger

> "Airport bro... Innum rendu hour-la flight. En idhayam Murali maari aagidum-nu kelambunen. Nenacha maariye Rapido-um kedaikala."

Driver

> "Airport thaan. Time irukku. Onnum aagathu. Vazhila oru tea kudippoma?"

Passenger (laughs)

> "Lift kudukreenga... tea-um vaangithareenga? Kandippa bro."

Small smile between strangers.

